      "settings": {
        "width": "full-width",
        "title": "Monster Piercing | Curved Barbells",
        "text": "<p>Curved barbells, also known as banana bars, are a popular choice for body piercings that follow the natural contours of the body, such as eyebrow, rook, and belly button piercings. Monster Piercing offers an extensive selection of curved barbells crafted from premium materials like surgical steel, titanium, and gold. The slight curve of the barbell ensures a comfortable fit, making it ideal for piercings in areas where straight barbells might cause discomfort or migration. Our curved bars come in a variety of sizes, gauges, and styles, including simple, unadorned bars for a minimalist look or more decorative options featuring gems, opals, or UV acrylics. The versatility of curved barbells makes them suitable for both initial piercings and long-term wear, and they are designed with smooth surfaces to prevent irritation and promote faster healing. Whether you’re looking for a classic design or something more eye-catching, curved barbells offer both comfort and style for body piercings that require a more tailored fit.</p>",
        "heading_size": "medium",
        "text_alignment": "center"
      }
    },
